Pi Our Free Model is an independent Pi-native implementation inspired by
https://github.com/Ebony-Vinyl/dsh-our-free-model (MIT, Copyright 2026 Ebony-Vinyl).
Inspected source revision: f8974369c5904858c696b520d8b9b82ad4425f78.

The upstream project documented Kilo's isFree model slice, public gateway,
reasoning object, mandatory-thinking model families, privacy disclosure and
incorrect SSE Content-Type behavior. These researched protocol conventions
informed this implementation. No DSH runtime, sealed EAC credentials, account
pool, upstream executable bundle, client-fingerprint impersonation, or vendor
artwork is distributed here. Original attribution is retained in LICENSE.

Pi-hosted API implementations and built-in metadata are provided by
@earendil-works/pi-ai, licensed by their respective copyright holders. Those
libraries are peer dependencies, not bundled into this extension.

The icon, hero, social preview and illustrated walkthrough are original vector
artwork for this project, distributed under the repository's MIT license.
Vendor names identify upstream services and do not imply endorsement.
